  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "On November 10, 2026, President Prabowo Subianto presided over an official ceremony at the Presidential Palace to grant the National Hero title to 19 individuals. The list includes a diverse array of figures recognized for their historical impact, ranging from military leaders and political figures to pioneers in economic development. Notable recipients include RM Margono Djojohadikusumo, founder of Bank Negara Indonesia, former police chief Hoegeng, and various military officials such as Maraden Panggabean and M. Jusuf, known for the ABRI Masuk Desa program. The awards also recognized local leaders and figures such as Ali Sadikin and Sultan Muhammad Ali Abdul Jalil Muazzam Syah. Various ministries and regional governments have highlighted these honors as opportunities to continue the legacy of these national heroes through modern initiatives, such as strengthening food security and fostering ongoing national progress.",
